#: ../../tools/inspirehep_tools.rst:32 36451c0c34864b65a124c88e9bdd303b
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search high-energy physics literature in the INSPIRE-HEP"
" database, the premier repository for physics papers in particle physics,"
" astrophysics, and related fields. Returns paper titles, authors, "
"abstract, citation count, DOI, and arXiv identifiers. No authentication "
"required. Search syntax: 'a einstein' (author), 't higgs' (title), 'j "
"phys.rev' (journal), 'cn cms' (collaboration), 'texkey smith:2024abc'. "
"Covers 1.6 million+ records."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/inspirehep_tools.rst:34 70ecfecc9e17491b9e42852c1c627745
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/inspirehep_tools.rst:36 1a8bedbc860241f790a417b4fd2df9fb
msgid ""
"``q`` (string) (required) INSPIRE search query. Examples: 'higgs boson "
"discovery', 'author:einstein', 'a:witten AND string theory', 'dark matter"
" direct detection', 'cn:atlas AND higgs', 't:gravitational waves'. Use "
"field prefixes: a: or author:, t: or title:, j: journal, cn: "
"collaboration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/inspirehep_tools.rst:39 42af073de56f4119aa1f5663561778cf
msgid ""
"``sort`` (string, null) (optional) Sort order. Values: 'mostrecent' "
"(default), 'mostcited'. Examples: 'mostcited' to get highest-cited papers"
" first"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/inspirehep_tools.rst:42 df734449e32145f4b790ee3a964c263f
msgid "``size`` (integer, null) (optional) Number of results (1-25). Default: 10"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/inspirehep_tools.rst:45 2671ceb492314bcf9fae98fec5993659
msgid ""
"``fields`` (string, null) (optional) Comma-separated fields to return. "
"Default includes titles, authors, abstract, citations. Example: "
"'titles,authors,abstract,citation\\_count,arxiv\\_eprints,dois'"
msgstr ""

